      "body": "点击下方的Demo视频：\n\n[![watch the video](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoMx2wTT3HMNLHZCBnRROm_oiIhhv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)](https://brieffeed.app/assets/brieffeed-combined-demo-93s.mp4)\n\n> [BriefFeed](https://brieffeed.app/)是个浏览器插件，它会在你社媒信息流的长帖子或外文上方加一行简短总结，帮你快速判断哪些值得细看，哪些可以滑过去。\n\n它已经支持了X/Twitter、即刻、微博等社媒平台，能明显减少看长帖时的阅读负担，也加了收藏和稍后读功能，方便把值得回看的帖子留下来。\n\n[**限时免费 · 点击安装BriefFeed（Chrome Web Store）**](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/brieffeed/lpolefkhiipebkomajgkcjglnfdjkeik)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FtecHWaO30ZaJZ_HVJz_JAdSwiXTv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FhSO812LxhrIQNdc3nVqbgw3fZRBv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FpvhTKMXtHijKzOAAdvEK2e3lV5Rv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n隐私方面，BriefFeed只处理你已经打开的页面里已加载的帖子内容。为了生成摘要，请求会包含帖子标题/正文、作者展示名、时间戳、平台和页面上识别到的链接等必要信息；不会发送登录态、cookies、关注列表、完整页面DOM，也不会通过平台API额外抓取你的时间线或未加载内容。原文不会在服务器持久化保存；只有你主动收藏的帖子会保存在浏览器本地。插件也可以随时暂停或关闭。\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FjPs3N-WX-spM74iJw6Ate9XN0Sev3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FndYo6dM7VpSXwA0TudnF6RKnySJv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FjtBpjHuB_H_sEaAs8mk_sRUhgc_v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fow8k6x1OgqAFPhrkMYSqi3Qa7QXv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n![image.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgjIvXo1v1kyRbE_1bw0r9RBdolgv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\nGitHub 只摘要公开项目，私有仓库会跳过。\n\n[Lobsters](https://lobste.rs/s/oznirn/redis_cost_ambition)及更多站点还在支持中，敬请期待。\n\n![brieffeed-lobsters-annotated-1280x800.png](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FjH53NMCbXcm2rBhAEsTxNOuUIXUv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)\n\n产品故事可看之前的[内测介绍](https://www.v2ex.com/t/1211756)，如果你感兴趣了，也可以扫码加入产品讨论群：\n\n![IMG_3723.jpeg](https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FpDGUN_B3Uco4-aFWuDJiNAVlq8nv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient)",
